---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of Service for StickerPants — your rights, our responsibilities, and the rules of using the app.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
      <a class="back inline-block mb-8 font-medium text-gray-900 hover:text-black transition" href="/">&larr; StickerPants</a>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="subtitle text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">StickerPants — Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
        <p>By using StickerPants ("app"), you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the app.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">1. What StickerPants Is</h2>
        <p>StickerPants turns your photos into stickers with on-device AI cutout, and sends them to WhatsApp as real stickers. Making stickers is free; <strong>StickerPants Pro</strong> unlocks unlimited everything for power users. The app is built by Taucity.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">2. Your Content</h2>
        <p>You own your photos and the stickers you create from them. We claim no ownership over your content. Sharing stickers to WhatsApp is governed by WhatsApp's own terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Use the app for any unlawful purpose.</li>
          <li>Create stickers from photos you do not have the right to use.</li>
          <li>Attempt to access other users' data (there is none — everything is on-device).</li>
          <li>Reverse-engineer or redistribute the app.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">4. Purchases, Subscriptions & Billing</h2>
        <p>StickerPants Pro is sold exclusively through <strong>Google Play Billing</strong>, with entitlement verification by RevenueCat. Subscriptions auto-renew each period until you cancel in the Google Play Store app (<strong>Play Store → Profile → Payments & subscriptions → Subscriptions</strong>); access continues until the end of the current billing period. Prices are shown at purchase in your local currency, inclusive of applicable taxes. You can restore a previous purchase from the paywall's <strong>Restore</strong> option on any device signed into the same Google account. Refunds are handled by Google Play under its refund policy.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The app design, code, branding, and assets are owned by Taucity. You may not copy, modify, or distribute any part of the app without permission.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">6. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The app is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of the app, including but not limited to data loss or service interruptions. AI cutout results are best-effort and may be imperfect.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms?<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:contact@taucity.xyz" class="text-gray-900 underline hover:text-black transition">contact@taucity.xyz</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
